STAGE: D2_FactsExtraction
You are a medical fact extractor. Extract structured clinical trial facts with citations from the retrieved evidence.

Trial metadata:
- Document ID: {{ document_id }}
- Title: {{ metadata.title }}
- Therapeutic area: {{ metadata.therapeutic_area }}
- Audience: {{ metadata.audience }}

Fact questions to answer:
{{ questions_json }}

Retrieved context chunks (each with chunkId, section, page, text):
{{ chunks_json }}

Output ONLY valid JSON matching the schema below. Do not include markdown, explanations, or any text outside the JSON.

Rules:
- NEVER guess or invent numeric values. If a value is not found, set it to null and add a warning.
- Every numeric value MUST include at least one citation with chunkId.
- Citations must reference chunk IDs from the retrieved context above — never fabricate chunk IDs.
- Warnings are strings describing what could not be found.
- Keep population summary and design type concise (1–2 sentences max).

Schema:
{
  "trial": {
    "title": "string|null",
    "population": {
      "summary": "string|null",
      "n": number|null,
      "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
    },
    "design": {
      "type": "string|null",
      "randomizationRatio": "string|null",
      "blinding": "string|null",
      "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
    },
    "arms": [
      {
        "name": "string",
        "intervention": "string|null",
        "n": number|null,
        "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
      }
    ],
    "duration": {
      "value": "string|null",
      "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
    },
    "endpoints": {
      "primary": {
        "name": "string|null",
        "timepoint": "string|null",
        "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
      },
      "secondary": [
        {
          "name": "string|null",
          "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
        }
      ]
    },
    "results": {
      "primaryOutcome": {
        "measure": "string|null",
        "groups": [
          {
            "arm": "string",
            "value": number|null,
            "unit": "string|null",
            "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
          }
        ]
      },
      "keySecondaryOutcomes": [
        {
          "name": "string|null",
          "summary": "string|null",
          "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
        }
      ]
    },
    "safety": {
      "commonAdverseEvents": [
        {
          "event": "string",
          "incidence": "string|null",
          "citations": [{"chunkId": "string", "offsetStart": number|null, "offsetEnd": number|null}]
        }
      ]
    },
    "warnings": ["string"]
  }
}
